APP_DIR       = /opt/eci-ocr
Then every push to main deploys to EC2.
To run manually on EC2:
ssh ec2-user@YOUR_EC2_HOST
cd /opt/eci-ocr
cp your.pdf inputs/
scripts/run_pdf.sh inputs/your.pdf
Output goes to:
outputs/your_result.json
