export DATABASE_URL='postgresql://USER:PASSWORD@HOST:5432/DBNAME'
scripts/run_pdf.sh inputs/your.pdf
One important EC2 note: port 22 must allow GitHub Actions to SSH into the instance, and the instance needs outbound internet for dnf/pip during deploy.

